Dependancies
============

Sqlkit depends on:

  * Python
  * Pygtk
  * sqlalchemy (>=0.5)
  * glade2
  * dateutils 
  * the correct driver for your database of choice


Installation
============

debian/ubuntu
-------------

I suggest using the deb package using this source:

   deb http://apt.argolinux.org lenny sqlkit




You can install it with 

    python setup.py install
